<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa, Frankfurt, Eurowings win awards.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa, Frankfurt, Eurowings win awards.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Lufthansa AG, Frankfurt airport(FAG) and German regional airline, Eurowings Luftverkehrs AG said they had won top awards in a poll of 4,000 business travellers from Germany, Switzerland and Austria.</p>
<p>Lufthansa won the top awards as best airline World, Europe and America as well as for the best short-haul and long-haul business classes in the annual reader survey by Business Traveller magazine.</p>
<p>FAG said it was named the best European airport as well as the best German airport, while Eurowings said it was chosen as Europe's best regional airline. --Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
